        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Directions",
            "icon": "washing",
            "content": "<p>Pour a small amount of Bubble Bath under running water in the tub or basin being used.  If more bubbles are desired, add more Bubble Bath. After finished soaking, rinse body with lukewarm water to remove any leftover soap or dirt.  <br/><br/>Cleanse the skin • Feels soothing for sore muscles • Relax • Deeper feeling sleep • Mood feels enhanced • Make bath time fun for kids • Easier to wash infants<br/><br/><em>Please note, children are slippery in a bubble bath.  Use caution when bathing infants, toddlers and children. Always keep one hand on them at all times.  NEVER leave them unattended in a bathtub or basin.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_RWrdXf": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "icon": "plant",
            "content": "<p>High-purity water, sodium C14-16 olefin sulfonate,<br/>cocamidopropyl hydroxysultaine, cocamidopropyl betaine, decyl glucoside,<br/>vegetable glycerin (glycerin), caprylyl capryl glucoside, polyquaternium 10,<br/>polysorbate 20 (food-grade), sodium benzoate, potassium sorbate, capryl glycol,<br/>phenoxyethanol, cucumis sativus fruit extract, DL-panthenol, citric acid</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredient Desctiptions",
            "icon": "eye",
            "content": "<p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-charcoal-filtered-deionized-water-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is High-Purity Water (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a> (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated water)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-sodium-c14-16-alpha-olefin-sulfonate-aos-40-and-what-does-it-do\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium C14-16 Alpha Olefin Sulfonate (AOS-40) and what does it do?\"><strong>Sodium C14-16 Olefin Sulfonate</strong></a> (coconut-based cleanser)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-cocamidopropyl-hydroxysultaine-sultaine-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine (Sultaine) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine</strong></a> (mild coconut-based cleanser)</p><p><strong>Cocamidopropyl Betaine</strong> (coconut-based cleanser)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-coco-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Coco-Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Coco-Glucoside</strong></a> (plant-based cleanser)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-glycerin-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Glycerin and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Vegetable Glycerin (glycerin)</strong></a> (plant-based, hydrates skin,<br/>USP kosher)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-caprylyl-capryl-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside</strong></a> (plant-based cleanser)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-food-grade-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Food-Grade Polysorbate 20 and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Polyquaternium 10 (gives skin soft feel)</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-food-grade-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Food-Grade Polysorbate 20 and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Polysorbate 20</strong></a> (food-grade, USP kosher with no dioxane,<br/>plant-based formula stabilizer)</p><p><strong>Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Capryl Glycol</strong> and<br/><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Phenoxyethanol in Personal Care Products: What You Need to Know\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a> (food-grade preservatives, used sparingly to prevent bacteria<br/>from growing in container)</p><p><strong>Cucumis Sativus Fruit Extract</strong> (Cucumber Extract, hydrates<br/>skin)</p><p><strong>DL-Panthenol</strong> (Provitamin B5, plant-based, hydrates skin)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Citric Acid and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Citric Acid </strong></a>(balances pH)</p>",
            "page": ""
